Vamos prosseguir com a traducao do hino 9:

009. Glory to His name!
referencias biblicas do hino: John 19:17-18 - Eph 1:7 - Col 1:20 - Heb 9:22 - 1 Pet 1:18-19

1. Down at the cross where my Savior died,
Where for redemption from sins I cried;
There to my heart was His blood applied;
Glory to His name!

    Refrain:	
    Glory to His holy name! 
    Glory to His holy name!
    There to my heart was His blood applied;
    Glory to His name!

2. I am so wondrously saved from sin,
Now Jesus deeply abides within.
There at the cross, Jesus took me in;
Glory to His name!

3. Oh, precious fountain that saves from sin,
I am so glad I have entered in.
There Jesus saves me and keeps me clean;
Glory to His name!

A partitura eh 4/4 em A bemol Maior, velocidade 95 seminimas

As notas sao:
Notas para as estrofes 1, 2 e 3:
verset 1: sm, c., sc, sm, c., sc, sm, sm, m
verset 2: sm, c., sc, sm, c., sc, sm, sm, m
verset 3: sm, c., sc, sm, c., sc, sm, sm, m
verset 4: sm., c, sm, sm, sb

notas para o refrain:
verset 1: sm., c, sm, sm, sm., c, m
verset 2: sm., c, sm, sm, sm., c, m
verset 3: sm, c., sc, sm, c., sc, sm, sm, m
verset 4: sm., c, sm, sm, sb

legenda: 
sb = semibreve
m = minima
sm = seminima
c = colcheia
sc = semicolcheia
sm. = seminima pontuada
c. = colcheia pontuada

A primeira estrofe e o refrain da musica podem serem ouvidos em https://soundcloud.com/fccusa/009-glory-to-his-name

Traduza, seguindo todas orientacoes ja discutidas, dentre elas: 
1. Manter o sentido da letra em ingles (se possivel);
2. Manter uma coesao biblica com os trechos de referencia;
3. Ser cantavel (forneci a sequencia de notas para as estrofes e refrao, siga-as) com luidez melódica e adequação silábica;
4. Escolher palavras apropriadas à velocidade da musica;
5. Preferir 1 silaba para cada som.
